*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0005
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-08-13 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-11-06 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 569
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0005.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    *> CUSTOMER AGE IN YEARS
    05 CUST-AGE           PIC 9(3).
    *> CURRENT LEDGER BALANCE
    05 LEDGER-BAL         PIC 9(9)V99.
    *> ACCOUNT TYPE S=SAVINGS C=CHECKING P=PREMIUM G=GOLD B=BUSINESS F=FIXED
    05 ACCT-TYP           PIC X.
       88 ACCT-FIXED VALUE 'F'.
    05 BASE-INT-RATE      PIC 9V9999.
01 OUT-RECORD.
    *> RATE AFTER BONUS
    05 BONUS-RATE         PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM APPLY-BONUS
    PERFORM FIXED-UPLIFT
    DISPLAY "BONUS-RATE=" BONUS-RATE
    STOP RUN.
APPLY-BONUS.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2004
    *>  IF CUST-AGE >= 48
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    *> SENIOR SAVER BONUS - LIMIT 90 PER 1998 POLICY
    IF CUST-AGE >= 60 AND LEDGER-BAL >= 10000
        COMPUTE BONUS-RATE = BASE-INT-RATE + 0.0025
    ELSE
        MOVE BASE-INT-RATE TO BONUS-RATE
    END-IF.
FIXED-UPLIFT.
    *> FIXED DEPOSIT UPLIFT
    IF ACCT-FIXED
        COMPUTE BONUS-RATE ROUNDED = BONUS-RATE + 0.0010
    END-IF.
